    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeata Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghang'eat siispa dooshta Lawi ak ghaghi hudeaba Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gagweayiit gatmooda ak gwaji baleanda, hean daah nea baleanda aamiy muuchi, ghafuy sheeh samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea mutghoamu ghafuy, hean gageanu sooscheanda sisna muudayga ak ghoanoar aba hideeda ea ganamda; amwahit ghwayiin baleanda jeeda, ng'ata ghwayiin jeeda muudayga mida ghuuta ghealooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ghamiinaada huda ghaamwat nea sheagi, ghwadaah gichea gabussa niny nea meadaaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deagheata ghwararang'aan hudeaba Farao goohuushi aba jeeda eenda, ak ghwadaah huda gadiyeeda nea gwaneayi aba ghuuta eenda; ak ghwadaah sooscheanda aba jeeda nyeega, hean goojeakta huda gadiyeeda gawa ghamwaghaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwajaat ghwadaah baleanda; nea abeeda baleanda gooyeawda. Ng'ata gwasawana jeadaanyi ak gwayi, “Nih gajea jeabwagi gil aba jeeda diibiga Ebraniya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda huda ghaamwat ak gwayeesha hudeaba Farao, “Gaydawa daguursa huda jea gooreerneey jeebi aba jeeda gadeemga fuga Ebraniya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda hudeaba Farao ak gwayeesha hudida, “Una.” Hean gawa hudida gaguursa gheamata baleanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda hudeaba Farao ak gwayeesha gatmoodida, “Aada jeebi ak guwi areernean, ak gaydagoonyi gidageatidaang'u.” Hean ghwaat gatmoodida baleanda gawa ghoarear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwaheedu baleanda ak ghwaat gatmoodida baleanda heeda hudeaba Farao ak ghoah orjeedaanyi; ak gaguura gheawungaaschi Musa, ak gwayi, “Aba gideaba gwayi ghaanyasi niny ghuuta beega.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa gamng'awsa ng'eanyiida Midiyani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha nea nihissa heeda Musa, gwarita gawa heeda fugaaschi, ak gang'ula sawanadeeda nyaawa, ak ghwadaah siida Misri nea ghabwar siida Ebraniya, bea jeeda fugaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goong'weersa meadajeega sean ak ea mwadaaha sih, ak ghabwar siidida bea Misrihiin ak gabuy aba jeeda iseaskweanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea gwarita eaweeda niirja, ghwadaah fih iyeenya bea Ebraniya nea gabearji, ak gwayeesha siidida adiiysa nirjeaniin, “Ghwasaan anda gibwari siida ghaheang'wa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Gagoonyi ng'eaha hawunda jea ambalaneasa ea argweakiiseasa? Gigasayi nuustanean gida inuusti siida Misrihi?” Hean ghabeal Musa ak gwayi, “Aba huumwa ng'asheanji sinal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iiy Farao ng'asheesu, gagasa gwanuus Musa. Ng'ata gamng'aw Musa aba madeeda Farao ak gawa goobiida ng'eanyiida Midiyani; ak goopteada aba ghuuta healadeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ashoohoocheanda ng'eanyiida Midiyani gwandeawa haw ispwa, ak ghapka ghwaram beega, ak ghoanyiit simajeega beega jea ghwaleaydaawa hawanyeanda nooga ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghapka jeagiischoodiga ak ghahoan haweegiga, ak ghamiinaada Musa ak ghaweat saawa, ak ghoaleayda hawanda nooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay ama hita heeda ghweanda nyaawa was Reueli gwayeesha, “Anda ean goobean abiikni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda saawa ak gwayeesha, “Gwanda siispa Misri weadeasa aba geatinga jeagiischoodiga, ak ea meakghusa nih gwaramu beega ak ghoaleayda hawanda nooga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ghweanda nyaawa ak gwayeesha haweagaaschi, “Ak gwanda yeenu? Ghwasaan anda goonung'usi heeda siida? Aguursiina eembuucheewana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamwas Musa goobiida gheedeaba siidida, ak ghoadaw Musa hudaanyi siguura Sipora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaji baleanda, ak gaguura gheawungaaschi Gershomu, aba gideaba gwayi, “Geawooschi rabascheanda aba ng'eanyiida buuneeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ng'ata eawoojiga saang'a ghami sugoocheanda Misri. Ghwanyas fuga Israeli sawanadeeda aba jeeda soomjeandumeeda nyaawa, ak gooyeawda nea gagasa weeta, ak ghwahita shooka nyaawa bea sawanadeeda heeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayiiy ASEETA shooka nyaawa, ak ghoapkaat ASEETA neajeadaanyi sea Abrahamu, ea Isaka, ea Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadaah ASEETA fuga Israeli, ak ghwanal ASEETA giduurji saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
